// The Mosslight overworld: nine rooms in a 3x3 grid. Geometry and doors were authored in phase 2;
// phase 3 adds the first enemy spawns, placed to encode spec §7's pacing ramp (see
// .autodev/phases/03-combat-enemies-determinism/PLAN.md): the start room and room.crossroads stay
// clear, slimes sit in the middle ring, bats in the north ring, and one guardian patrols the far
// corner. Chests, NPCs and the dungeon are authored in later phases.
